# Frontend scope rules (Lead360) — full rules in ../.claude/rules/stacks/react.rules.md
# React Router 7 (framework mode). Source dir: app/ (NOT src/). Import alias: ~/ -> app/.
# TS strict. Tailwind v4. Redux async thunks for READ (createAsyncThunk in service files),
# direct service calls for mutations. Shadcn/UI in components/ui. Domain types in app/types/*.d.ts.
# Every interactive element carries data-testid. No dead buttons. No hardcoded mock data.
